<title>USA: AFTER THE BELL - After-hours activity calm.</title>
<headline>AFTER THE BELL - After-hours activity calm.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>After-hours trading was calm on Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>3Com Corp was trading down 5/8 at 76-1/8.</p>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said volume for session one was 78,900 shares, compared to 98,500 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Session two had 3,995,154 shares. There was no volume for session two on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
